  "label": "The image of a smiling, dignified older man in formal attire as a symbol of success or fulfillment",
  "description": "The visual of an older, well-dressed, smiling man is often culturally associated with wisdom, achievement, and contentment. This trope is used in media and advertising to represent the rewards of hard work and a life well-lived. The image leverages this cultural association to reinforce the inspirational message.",
